   "subject": "Re: [geomorph-r-package] Two different means",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">David, to add to what Dean explained, if one used a geomorph internal function, called cs.scale (scaling by centroid size), then the answers are the same.<div><br></div><div>E.g.,</div><div><br></div><div>mu2 &lt;- geomorph:::cs.scale(mshape(gpagen(X, Proj=FALSE)$coords))</div><div><br></div><div>This changes mu2 to be unit size, like the consensus.</div><div><br></div><div>Mike</div><div><br><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"></blockquote></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div>On Feb 8, 2017, at 5:48 PM, Adams, Dean [EEOBS] &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dca...@iastate.edu</a>&gt; wrote:</div><br></blockquote></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><a name=\"m_-2156674706632054683__MailEndCompose\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">David,<u></u><u></u></span></a></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">The reason is that proj=FALSE retains the specimens in shape space which is curved. Thus, the mshape obtained from these will actually be found inside the shape space and not on it. As an analogy, imagine finding the measure of central tendency of points on part of a circle: the arithmetic mean is inside the circle, not on it.  Rohlf 1999 has some conceptual graphics that relate to the projection and scaling in GPA which relates to this.<u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Now if you notice, the consensus configuration, even from proj=FALSE is identical to all of the proj=TRUE mean estimates. This is because the consensus used during GPA is at unit centroid size, meaning it is a point on shape space. It is also the point of tangency with tangent space, so these 3 all match up.<u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Basically, the second option of the 4 you list is different from the rest because it is incorrect. The mean of the shapes on the curved shape space is a mean shape, but is not of unit centroid size. Hence the different coordinates.<span> </span><u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Hope this helps.<u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Dean<u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Dr. Dean C. Adams</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Professor</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Department of Ecology, Evolution, and Organismal Biology</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">       Department of Statistics</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">Iowa State University</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><a href=\"http://www.public.iastate.edu/~dcadams/\" style=\"color:purple;text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.public.iastate.edu/~dcadams/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792486178932000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2XCu6WEHlVMaxHVZRGEsnN\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:purple\">www.public.iastate.edu/~dcadams/</span></a><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">phone: <a href=\"tel:(515)%20294-3834\" value=\"+15152943834\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">515-294-3834</a></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span> </span><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-...@googlegroups.com</a> [<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mailto:geomorph-...@googlegroups.com</a>]<span> </span><b>On Behalf Of<span> </span></b>David Katz<br><b>Sent:</b><span> </span>Wednesday, February 8, 2017 4:37 PM<br><b>To:</b><span> </span>geomorph R package &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b><span> </span>[geomorph-r-package] Two different means<u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">Hi everyone,<u></u><u></u></div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></div></div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">Why are these not the same thing?<u></u><u></u></div></div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></div></div><div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">mu &lt;- gpagen(X, Proj=<b><i>FALSE</i></b>)$consensus<u></u><u></u></div></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 12pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">mu2 &lt;- mshape(gpagen(X, Proj=<b><i>FALSE</i></b>)$coords)<u></u><u></u></p></div></div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">... but these are<u></u><u></u></div></div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></div></div><div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">mu &lt;- gpagen(X, Proj=<b><i>TRUE</i></b>)$consensus<u></u><u></u></div></div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">mu2 &lt;- mshape(gpagen(X, Proj=<b><i>TRUE</i></b>)$coords)<u></u><u></u></div></div></div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></div></div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">It relates to the fact that when tangent projection is turned off (FALSE), the centroid size of the mshape-derived mean is not 1. <u></u><u></u></div></div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></div></div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">Thanks.<u></u><u></u></div></div><div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\"><br>David<u></u><u></u></div></div></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">--<span> </span><br>You received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;geomorph R package&quot; group.<br>To unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to<span> </span><a href style=\"color:purple;text-decoration:underline\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-r-pack...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>To post to this group, send email to<span> </span><a href style=\"color:purple;text-decoration:underline\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>Visit this group at<span> </span><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/group/geomorph-r-package\" style=\"color:purple;text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/group/geomorph-r-package&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792486178932000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0AY6SwRo_6dgL793X7n-wJ\">https://groups.google.com/group/geomorph-r-package</a>.<br>To view this discussion on the web, visit<span> </span><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/geomorph-r-package/f77ffc93-8892-4e3c-b92e-dfeadb39c7a6%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" style=\"color:purple;text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/geomorph-r-package/f77ffc93-8892-4e3c-b92e-dfeadb39c7a6%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792486178932000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3V1PJfHW_79-R0abkfBaig\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/geomorph-r-package/f77ffc93-8892-4e3c-b92e-dfeadb39c7a6%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>For more options, visit<span> </span><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" style=\"color:purple;text-de